    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index rose by 207 points in the two weeks to 10 January to 6,638, up by 1,106 points year-on-year. There was a $0.80/t increase in the W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate to $9.65/t, while the round-voyage rate increased by $1,650/day to $18,150/day.",
